# Windows text files keep their exact bytes (UTF-8 BOM + CRLF): README.txt is read by Notepad on
# the user's PC and build.ps1 by Windows PowerShell 5.1, which needs the BOM for Korean text.
*.ps1 -text
*.bat -text
*.txt -text

# C# / WPF sources: normalized to LF in the repo, native line endings on checkout.
*.cs       text
*.xaml     text
*.csproj   text
*.manifest text
*.svg      text
*.yml      text
*.md       text

*.ico binary
*.png binary
